          "key": "scope_touched",
          "type": "checklist",
          "label": "Flooring scope worked this shift",
          "items": [
            "Area isolation, furniture movement, protection, and occupied phasing",
            "Existing flooring removal, salvage, disposal, and hazard release",
            "Substrate cleaning, grinding, patching, leveling, and crack treatment",
            "Moisture and alkalinity testing, mitigation, and acceptance",
            "Underlayment, membrane, sound control, vapor control, and primers",
            "Layout, pattern, dye lot, seam, joint, and room transition planning",
            "Resilient, carpet, wood, laminate, tile, stone, or specialty installation",
            "Adhesive, mortar, grout, weld, fastener, and rolling requirements",
            "Base, trim, reducers, thresholds, stair, and edge details",
            "Protection, cure, cleaning, maintenance stock, and owner handoff"
