        {
          "key": "daily_boundary",
          "type": "notice",
          "label": "Flooring daily-report boundary",
          "guidance": "This record does not clear existing flooring, mastic, or substrate for disturbance and does not replace hazardous-material assessment, silica controls, moisture-system design, or manufacturer instructions. The daily report records observed facts and does not itself release work or close required actions."
        }
